      const bestTrack=a||b?`More applications were logged on Track ${a>=b?'A':'B'} (${Math.max(a,b)} vs ${Math.min(a,b)}).`:'No applications have been logged this week yet.';
      text=`WEEKLY STRATEGY DEBRIEF — Week of ${new Date(`${start}T12:00:00`).toLocaleDateString(undefined,{month:'long',day:'numeric',year:'numeric'})}\n\nAPPLICATIONS & FUNNEL\nApplications submitted: ${weekApplications.length} (Track A: ${a} · Track B: ${b})\nStatuses indicating a response: ${responded.length}\nTracked response rate: ${responseRate}${weekApplications.length?'':' (no applications logged)'}\nInterviews currently active: ${interviews.length}\nOffers: ${weekApplications.filter(j=>j.status==='Offer').length}\n\nSEARCH OPERATIONS\nCadence tasks marked complete: ${completedTasks} of ${totalTasks} scheduled through today\nConnection sprint tasks completed: ${connections} (this records task completion, not a verified introduction)\nFollow ups currently due: ${followups.length}\n\nTRACK COMPARISON\nTrack A applications: ${a}\nTrack B applications: ${b}\n${bestTrack}\nWarm vs. cold referral conversion is not yet available because outreach sources are not recorded in the app.\n\nNEXT WEEK\nKeep the lower volume track in view while prioritizing roles with a clear fit and a recent posting date. Reserve time to complete one specific connection task and review due follow ups.\n\nGenerated by Chronicle from the applications and tasks currently logged in JobOps.`;
